<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Isaiah Rodriguez | Portfolio</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles.css">
</head>

<body>

  <header class="hero hero-home">

    <%- include('partials/nav') %>

    <div class="hero-home-grid">

      <div class="hero-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">Software Developer</p>

        <h1>Isaiah Rodriguez</h1>

        <p class="hero-lead">
          Building practical web applications across the frontend and backend
          with JavaScript, React, Node.js, APIs, and databases.
        </p>

        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a href="/projects" class="primary-button">
            View Projects
          </a>

          <a href="/contact" class="secondary-button">
            Contact Me
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="hero-meta">
          <span>React</span>
          <span>Node.js</span>
          <span>MongoDB</span>
          <span>SQL</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="hero-photo-wrap">
        <div class="hero-photo-glow"></div>

        <img
          src="/images/headshot.png"
          alt="Isaiah Rodriguez"
          class="hero-photo"
        >
      </div>

    </div>

  </header>

  <main>

    <section class="home-intro">

      <div class="home-intro-label">
        <span>01</span>
        <p>About</p>
      </div>

      <div class="home-intro-content">
        <h2>From enterprise IT to software development.</h2>

        <p>
          I’m a software developer with a background in information technology
          and six years of experience in the United States Air Force. After
          earning my B.S. in Computer Science, I shifted my focus toward
          building modern web applications and strengthening my skills across
          frontend and backend development.
        </p>

        <p>
          I enjoy solving problems, learning new technologies, and turning
          ideas into functional applications that are useful, maintainable,
          and easy to work with.
        </p>

        <a href="/experience" class="inline-link">
          View my experience →
        </a>
      </div>

    </section>

  </main>

</body>
</html>